            <title>[IGNITE-3834] BinaryReader.get method behaves incorrectly when in MODE_SINGLE mode</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3834</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The piece of code below is incorrect. It should not return the &lt;tt&gt;data&lt;/tt&gt; right away, but compare the provided position with &lt;tt&gt;singlePos&lt;/tt&gt; first and return &lt;tt&gt;null&lt;/tt&gt; if they do not match.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; MODE_SINGLE:
     &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; (T)data;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
